{"type":"assistant","uuid":"01a1b5a5-c922-7f0b-b598-e2c180f555fb","session_id":"01a1b5a4-00dc-7683-9b43-241448a2c172","message":{"id":"01a1b5a5694675abad2699bc111b948f","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"chatcmpl-tool-97c4840df2fc94e7","name":"Grep","input":{"pattern":"inject|webServer|register|effect|apply\\(|ctx\\.","path":"c:\\git\\dsh-CLIWorker","output_mode":"content","-n":true}}],"model":"hy4-free","role":"assistant","stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":45516,"output_tokens":1174,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":768,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null}},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-827575f7ba1d9f17","_requestId":"09c282c531e94711ae7a1325623b4ff4","_messageId":"01a1b5a5694675abad2699bc111b948f","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"09c282c531e94711ae7a1325623b4ff4","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a1b5a5694675abad2699bc111b948f","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a1b5a5694675abad2699bc111b948f"},"__timestamp":"2026-11-07T10:55:03.459Z"}
{"type":"user","uuid":"01a1b5a5-c930-74a7-9170-2056274fc5d2","session_id":"01a1b5a4-00dc-7683-9b43-241448a2c172","message":{"content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9b7608d7bcc9daee","content":[{"type":"text","text":"   1→# CLIWorker\n   2→\n   3→AgentLine 的独立模型层。AgentLine 只保留“模型来源”指针；provider/CLI、模型列举、可用性、价格、用量与预测全部由 CLIWorker 负责。\n   4→\n   5→## 边界\n   6→\n   7→```text\n   8→AgentLine  --ModelRequest JSON-->  CLIWorker  --ModelSelection JSON-->  AgentLine\n   9→```\n  10→\n  11→- AgentLine 不读取 provider CLI、不维护价格表、不做预测。\n  12→- CLIWorker 可以独立安装、替换、禁用。\n  13→- AgentLine 的 `modelSource` 只保存 CLIWorker 的启动配置。\n  14→\n  15→## CLI\n  16→\n  17→```bash\n  18→node bin/cliworker.mjs providers\n  19→node bin/cliworker.mjs models list\n  20→node bin/cliworker.mjs models list --all\n  21→node bin/cliworker.mjs models select --request '{\"role\":\"dev\",\"tier\":\"top\",\"count\":2,\"importance\":\"high\"}'\n  22→node bin/cliworker.mjs models forecast --model hy4free\n  23→node bin/cliworker.mjs usage record --json '{\"model\":\"hy4free\",\"input_tokens\":1000,\"output_tokens\":500}'\n  24→node bin/cliworker.mjs usage summary\n  25→```\n  26→\n  27→所有输出都是 JSON。\n  28→\n  29→## 配置\n  30→\n  31→默认配置：`$CLIWORKER_HOME/config.json`（默认 `~/.cliworker/config.json`）。  \n  32→参考 `config/cliworker.example.json`。\n  33→\n  34→配置包含：\n  35→\n  36→- providers：CLI、adapter、版本/认证命令、是否可强制只读\n  37→- models：provider、id、tier、identity、vendor、价格、弃用\n  38→- quotas：各渠道剩余额度/窗口\n  39→\n  40→## AgentLine 集成\n  41→\n  42→AgentLine 仅保存：\n  43→\n  44→```json\n  45→\"modelSource\": {\n  46→  \"kind\": \"cliworker\",\n  47→  \"command\": \"node\",\n  48→  \"args\": [\"C:/git/dsh-CLIWorker/bin/cliworker.mjs\", \"--config\", \"C:/git/dsh-CLIWorker/config/cliworker.local.json\"]\n  49→}\n  50→```\n  51→\n  52→选模时调用：\n  53→\n  54→```text\n  55→cliworker models select --request <ModelRequest>\n  56→```\n  57→\n  58→返回的 `models[]` 是 `ModelHandle[]`，AgentLine 按顺序尝试。\n  59→\n  60→## 安全\n  61→\n  62→- 未验证 identity、不可调用、弃用模型不会出现在候选中。\n  63→- `rejected[]` 保留原因，便于审计。\n  64→- 预测缺样本返回 `unknown`，不伪造通过。\n  65→\n  66→"}],"is_error":false}],"role":"user"},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-827575f7ba1d9f17","_requestId":"09c282c531e94711ae7a1325623b4ff4","_messageId":"01a1b5a5694675abad2699bc111b948f","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"09c282c531e94711ae7a1325623b4ff4","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a1b5a5694675abad2699bc111b948f","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a1b5a5694675abad2699bc111b948f"},"__timestamp":"2026-11-07T10:55:03.473Z"}
