xt: AC-038 定为 levels smoke、baseline real-smoke，通过来源是维护者真机 real smoke 的 wsl-discover 步骤；但 milestone-gate --milestone M5 要求「属主任务在 Mx 及以前的 AC 全部 covered 并在完整运行中通过」，而 real 模式在未设 CLIWORKER_SMOKE=1 时返回 E_SMOKE_DISABLED、CI 无 WSL，完整运行无法让 AC-038 通过。T-029 又只写了 test/smoke/wsl-discover.test.mjs（报告条目校验）作为可在完整运行跑的测试。需明确：milestone-gate 只认该报告条目校验测试的 covered/pass（与 baseline 无关），real 报告仅由 release-gate 消费；并补一条规则说明 real-smoke AC 不参与 milestone-gate 的「完整运行通过」判定，否则 M5 门不可判定。\n\nHmm, actually re-reading milestone-gate: \"属主任务在 Mx 及以前的 AC 全部 covered，并且在完整运行中通过。\" It doesn't say baseline-aware. So for AC-038, \"在完整运行中通过\" would be the `wsl-discover.test.mjs` report-entry test. That could pass. So maybe not a hard contradiction — but the design never states that AC-038's full-run test is `wsl-discover.test.mjs` nor that its `[AC-038]` title lives there. And AC-038's text defines pass as the real smoke step. So there IS ambiguity: the AC text says \"步骤状态为 pass\" (the smoke step), while milestone-gate wants \"完整运行中通过\" (a test). Two different artifacts. I'll frame it as an ambiguity that must be resolved, with the resolution direction. Keep as open.\n\nActually, let me strengthen: also note AC-038's `real-smoke` baseline with `levels:[\"smoke\"]` — AC-004 says smoke baseline must be `linux` or `real-smoke`, OK. But AC-070 says dry-run报告永远不能满足 real-smoke. And T-029's dry-run smoke has a `wsl-discover` step with `ac:['AC-038']` (AC-038 text: \"dry-run 中同名步骤使用夹具，其 pass 不计入 real-smoke 基线\"). So the dry-run report declares AC-038 with pass but doesn't count. Need the traceability/test to not accidentally treat that as covered. OK.\n\n2. **TB-2 (open)**: `CLIWORKER_TEST_CLOCK_FILE` 进程级环境变量的隔离与语义冲突.\n   Text: F-01 把它定义为跨进程时钟文件，且「只要设置了该变量，CLI 每次输出都带 W_TEST_CLOCK」；AC-061 又把「设置该变量」列为注入故障，使 doctor 以 E_HEALTH_DEGRADED(退出码 9) 退出、health 返回 degraded；AC-072 需要在进程内设置它来验证 createContext，AC-064 在子进程 env 设置它。check-fast 最终在同一 node --test 进程里跑完整 npm test，任一测试若未在 finally 恢复该变量，就会污染后续测试：AC-024「README 示例 warnings 都为空」、A